  "text": "Skip to content\nSoren Hale\n01\nWork\n02\nServices\n03\nAbout\n04\nLab\n05\nWriting\nOpen to work from November\nGet in touch\n~\nWork\nBrattvik Onboarding\n\n// Case study\n\nBrattvik Onboarding \n\nOpening an account went from eleven screens to four.\n\nVisit the live site\n\nApplications completed\nfrom\n38%\n→\nto\n71%\n\nClient\nBrattvik Bank\nYear\n2022\nRole\nSenior frontend developer\nKind\nProduct\n01\nThe problem\n\nBrattvik's sign-up asked for everything up front and lost most people at the identity check.\n\n02\nThe approach\nOne question per screen, saved as you go, so a dropped connection never costs an answer.\nValidation runs on the same schema in the browser and on the server.\nThe identity check opens in place instead of in a new tab.\nA laptop with a dark dashboard, a phone and a hand reaching in, in an office at dusk\nPhone wireframe sketches on paper and a hand with a pen\n03\nThe result\n\nCompleted applications rose from 38% to 71%. The median time to open an account is now under four minutes.\n\nBuilt with\n\nNext.js\nTypeScript\nZod\nPlaywright\n\nNext case\nWeb · 2022\nLoopdocs\nDeveloper docs that load at once and search as you type.\n\n// Start a project\n\nTell me what you are building. \n\nThree quick picks so the first reply is useful. You finish the message on the contact page.\n\n01\nWhat do you need?\n\nFrontend build\nPerformance audit\nDesign system\nTeam embed\nSomething else\n\n02\nRough budget\n\nUnder €5k\n€5–10k\n€10–25k\n€25k+\nNot sure yet\n03\nYour name or company\nbrief.ts\ndraft, not sent\nexport const brief = {\nkind: null // not picked yet,\nbudget: null // not picked yet,\nname: null // not picked yet,\n}\n\nBrief so far: nothing picked yet\n\nContinue to contact\n\nor write to hello@sorenhale.dev\n\nNothing is sent from this page. Your picks are kept in this browser tab and wait for you on the contact form.\n\nFooter\n\nFrontend developer, Oslo\n\nWrite to me\nhello@sorenhale.dev\n\nOpen to work from November\n\n// Site\n\nWork\nServices\nProcess\nReviews\nContact\n\n// About\n\nAbout\nResume\nStack\nUses\nNow\n\n// More\n\nLab\nWriting\nFAQ\nPrivacy\nTerms\nCookies\n\n// Elsewhere\n\nGitHub\n↗\n(opens in a new tab)\nLinkedIn\n↗\n(opens in a new tab)\nBluesky\n↗\n(opens in a new tab)\n\nLocal time, Oslo\n17:02 CEST\n\n© 2026 Soren Hale. Written by hand in Oslo.\n\nSorenHale\n\nCreate a free website with Framer, the website builder loved by startups, designers and agencies.\n\nEdit Content",
